  "estudio": "论证与抽象思维·限定观点",
  "alumno": "Argument and abstract thinking: Qualifying a claim"
 },
 "intro": "HSK 6 unit: study the assigned vocabulary for qualifying a claim, review its pronunciation and check the meanings given by the source. Practise consecutive actions with the structure 一……就…….",
 "palabras": [],
